   <media:title>Dior Beauty Holiday 2026</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/PqOGLljj9Lw?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/PqOGLljj9Lw/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Step into the magical world of Dior Christmas at 30 Montaigne, where the Atelier of Dreams comes to life with enchanting gingerbread creations, iconic fragrances, luxurious gifts, and festive beauty. A celebration of craftsmanship, and holiday magic.

This year, the iconic Atelier of Dreams becomes a magical confectionery atelier filled with festive charm, exquisite craftsmanship, and irresistible sweet-inspired creations. Behind its majestic façade, Dior celebrates the art of gifting with beautifully adorned gift boxes, delicate sugar icing, golden details, satin ribbons, and gingerbread-inspired Christmas ornaments that capture the timeless elegance of the House.

Discover the magic of iconic Dior creations, from Miss Dior, J’adore, and Sauvage fragrances to Dior Prestige skincare and luminous makeup treasures. The collection also features exquisite gingerbread-inspired ornaments, including a selection of eight iconic House products reimagined as festive decorations, accompanied by the delightful Dior Délice fragrance with its irresistible gingerbread notes.

Inspired by Christian Dior’s extraordinary art of living, this magical celebration pays tribute to the House’s heritage, creativity, and passion for beauty. Every detail, from the golden Médaillon to the sparkling sugar decorations, reflects the exceptional craftsmanship and sophisticated elegance that define Dior.</media:description>
