   <media:title>Dior Holiday 2026 Cinnamon Glaze Look by Peter Philips</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/1l18VsQSSP0?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/1l18VsQSSP0/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Discover the Dior Cinnamon Glaze Holiday Look, imagined and created by Peter Philips, Creative and Image Director of Dior Makeup.

For the festive season, Dior makeup icons are adorned with the signature Médaillon, revealing a limited-edition collection inspired by the warm, gourmand hues of honey and cinnamon.

Explore the Diorshow 5 Couleurs eyeshadow palette in 623 Cinnamon Glaze, featuring the iconic Cannage motif and pearlescent details. Discover the sparkling Dior holiday lip balm, the Rouge Dior Sequin Liquid Duo in new gourmand shades, and the iconic Dior Addict lip favourites for glittery colour and ultra-shine.
Completing the collection, Dior Forever Glow Luminizer in 029 Frozen Médaillon illuminates the complexion with golden pearlescent pigments, unveiled in a couture-inspired design.

From luminous lips to captivating eyes and radiant skin, discover the art of festive beauty through the timeless codes of Dior.</media:description>
